  "deviations": [
    "The shell's header (bell, Help, profile) is the app's own and is not part of this screen's work; the board's header has no bell.",
    "Gap: 'Changed 3 months ago' under Password has no data (the API does not say when the password changed); the board's line is hidden on the artboard.",
    "Gap: slice O is not built. The organisations list shows the name and role only: 'just you' / '4 people', the Settings and Leave links, the note about leaving a team, 'If you can't carry on' (records custodian) and 'Close your account' have no screen or endpoint yet (no /v1/me/custodian, /v1/me/close, organisation members). They are hidden on the artboard.",
    "The board's 'This device' row has no sign-out link; the page keeps it so signing out stays reachable, and the artboard is given the same link (artboardCss).",
    "Text the board sets at 14 to 16px is 17px (back link, buttons, notes, 'On' badge); links and buttons keep 52px hit areas with negative margins so the layout is the board's."
  ]
